				10
			],
			"Message": "fix(Mountain): Fix shell PATH, git cache, build constraints, and import paths\n\n**EnhanceShellEnvironment** — Allow shell PATH to override the Finder/Dock\nminimal default (`/usr/bin:/bin:/usr/sbin:/sbin`) when `IsTty()` is false,\nso git, Node, and language servers resolve correctly after launchd/Dock\nlaunches.\n\n**HandleIsAvailable** — Cache only a `true` result. A transient `false`\nfrom the first git probe (fired before EnhanceShellEnvironment extends\nPATH) must not permanently disable the SCM UI.\n\n**CocoonService/mod.rs** — Remove `prepare_call_hierarchy` and\n`prepare_type_hierarchy` gRPC handlers that were prematurely introduced\nin the previous commit. Rename `GenericNotification` and `GenericRequest`\nimports with `Msg` aliases to avoid name clashes with sibling modules.\n\n**Import path fixes** — Qualify `MountainVinegRPCService` path in\nRegisterLanguageProvider and call `RunTime()` as a method; fix `MetricType`\nimport alias in DashboardHelpers; add missing `CommandExecutor` import in\nGenericNotification and GenericRequest commands.\n\n**build.rs** — Gate `tauri_build::build()` behind an absent\n`CARGO_BUILDING_DOCS` var so `cargo doc` succeeds without Sky Astro assets.\n\n**tauri.conf.json** — Add Brotli pre-bake as `beforeBundleCommand`.\n\nBump `Record` to 1 in Info.plist.",
			"SHA": "36c8655681c646f7f1119aac1cbca04346b69d91"
		},
